that work.

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:53.549
The Republican Party is not offering to concede
anything.

00:03:53.549 --> 00:03:57.749
The Democratic proposal is one point nine
trillion and it's popular with the American

00:03:57.749 --> 00:03:58.749
people.

00:03:58.749 --> 00:04:00.200
Republicans are just saying no.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:05.059
Is the concession that they will grant any
money because remember, many Republican voters

00:04:05.059 --> 00:04:07.090
want the stimulus package as well.

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:11.290
This is not a stimulus package that is only
popular with Democratic voters.

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:13.069
Republicans are not conceding anything.

00:04:13.069 --> 00:04:18.690
They are negotiating when they don't actually
have leverage if Joe Biden and Democrats are

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:22.660
actually ready and willing to pass this without
a single Republican vote.

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:28.900
So my suggestion is ignore the bad faith whining
of Republicans.

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:35.340
Democrats are passing popular bills that 60,
70, 80 percent of Americans support.

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:39.440
The executive order on asking from Joe Biden.

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:44.759
And you can't you know, we talk about we don't
want to stoop to their level.

00:04:44.759 --> 00:04:46.069
We don't want to do what they do.

00:04:46.069 --> 00:04:47.970
Listen, we're not obstructing anything.

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:50.560
Joe Biden one Democrats control the House.

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:56.720
Democrats took the Senate voters, including
independents, Democrats, but also Republicans

00:04:56.720 --> 00:04:58.199
want the stimulus.

00:04:58.199 --> 00:04:59.319
So just pass it.

00:04:59.319 --> 00:05:00.530
You gave them their meeting.

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:01.629
It's time to pass it.

00:05:01.629 --> 00:05:03.340
You promised you would do it.

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:04.940
And I hope that they actually do.

00:05:04.940 --> 00:05:09.009
This could be the first major success of the
Biden administration.

00:05:09.009 --> 00:05:14.540
And it will show that it's Joe Biden who will
set the agenda and Democrats, not Mitch McConnell,

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:17.090
or this will be the first major failure for
Joe Biden.

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:18.540
And it will be a big failure.

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:24.810
When you say if I win and OSF and Warnaco
in 2000, checks are going out right away and

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:30.539
