pathetic and paltry.

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:35.639
That's not going to look good.

00:05:35.639 --> 00:05:37.470
So it's time to get it together.

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:41.280
Let's, as we like to say, put on our big boy
pants and get this thing done.

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:43.199
These people, these Republicans are not your
friends.

00:05:43.199 --> 00:05:44.240
They're not going to help you.

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:45.520
They're not looking to compromise.

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:47.220
They're looking to get in your way.

00:05:47.220 --> 00:06:48.289
You've got to go round them on this important
